      "value": "I saw this has changed to \"NEEDS MORE INFORMATION\" and tested it again just now.\n\nThis issue seems to no longer be present in the current live build. :)\n\nIt seems to have been fixed silently or trough other changes that no longer cause this to happen. :D\n\nThis is true for both the change avatar, and the other UI triggers that caused it before. (like OSC)",
