  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "In Desktop mode, changing your avatar on the main avatar menu while being prone and keeping the UI open, will scale the UI to massive size.\n\nThis does not apply to changes trough the wing menu, nor does this affect crouch position.\n\nDemonstration: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4CHtHa8iBDk\n\nReproduction steps:\n\n- Play in Desktop mode.\n\n- Go into prone position (Not crouch)\n\n- Open the quick menu and click on the \"Avatars\" button.\n\n- Pick any avatar you want.\n\n- Press change, but keep the UI open.\n\n- UI scale is now busted till UI is closed and opened again.",
